            "review_title": "Review at Pao Cafe",
            "review_text": "Tiffany T\nHCMC131 contributions\n0\nWarm things\nDec 2013 • Friends\nPao is set in a nice quiet, very Vietnamese street off Bui Vien and appears to be a normal coffee shop. However they do really good food. The staff here always greeted us with a warm genuine smile and always provided us with first class service each time. We tried their fried rice, fried noodles, Vietnamese pancake which were all delicious! Service was good and the meals are averagely priced, not too expensive!\nThanks for the small reminder of home. Highly recommend!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 11, 2013",
            "rating": 5.0,
