            "review_text": "Kiwi_Nicko_85\nDee Why, Australia30 contributions\n0\nGet the hot pot\nJan 2013 • Couples\nThis restaurant is a diamond in the rough.. The whole street is littered with cheap tacky restaurants so wasn't expecting much. We decided to get the beef in lime as an entree which was very good. We both ordered hotpots (listed on the menu to take 20-30minutes) which were well worth the wait. All in all really enjoyed it. The staff were nice and attentive without being pushy and the prices are very reasonable (we paid $259vnd for 2 meals entrees and a drink)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 22, 2013",
