            "review_text": "A Tripadvisor Member\nxxx35 contributions\n0\nGood caramel pork and ginger tea and great project\nJan 2013 • Friends\nWe choose Pao because close to our hotel and after hours around Ho Chi Mihn it was a great deal. The caramel pork and salads are good and the ginger tea as well. The service is nice, indeed very nice compared to other cafè we have tried close by. You can also find interesting tours, socially committed.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 13, 2013",
