            "review_text": "Adam\nElwood, Australia67 contributions\n0\nNothing Special\nNov 2012\nNo Yelp in Vietnam so hit up tripadvisor and ended up here. After getting homemade fat litle thumbs-like spring rolls in Hanoi, these were more like the packaged ones in Viet places back at home. Also had the Pho, again, nothing special. Service was fine. Prices were more than I was paying in Hanoi, 22k for a beer, 50k for the rolls and 60k for the pho.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 13, 2012",
